{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1518","id":4022273425,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87vvwWR","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1518","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1518.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1518.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1518","number":1518,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"chore: install git hooks from trusted runtime snapshot","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nReplaces mutable worktree-based local hook execution with trusted installed hook artifacts under Git metadata.\n\n- Adds `scripts/git-hooks/install-trusted-hooks.js` to copy `scripts/git-hooks/guardrails.js` into `.git/ciecopilot-hooks/guardrails.js` and generate trusted hook artifacts.\n- Generated `.git/hooks/pre-commit` and `.git/hooks/pre-push` files are POSIX shell wrappers that call the fixed trusted runner `.git/ciecopilot-hooks/hook-runner.cjs` with `\"$@\"`.\n- The trusted `.cjs` runner uses CommonJS, verifies the SHA256 of `.git/ciecopilot-hooks/guardrails.js`, dynamically imports the ESM runtime, and calls `runtime.main(['--hook', hookName, ...argv])`.\n- Keeps `npm run git:hooks:install` as the public installer entry point through the existing `scripts/git-hooks/install.sh` shim.\n- Changes committed `.githooks/pre-commit` and `.githooks/pre-push` to fail closed and explain that `.githooks` are templates, not trusted enforcement.\n- Updates workflow hook-install checks and docs to use `.git/hooks` plus `.git/ciecopilot-hooks/guardrails.js` instead of the old `.git/ao-hooks` copy path.\n\n## Security Boundary\n\nThe previous installed hook flow copied committed `.githooks` wrappers that executed `node scripts/git-hooks/guardrails.js ...` from the active worktree. In task branches, PR worktrees, and agent worktrees, that guardrail code is mutable by the same branch being checked.\n\nThis PR moves the installed enforcement runtime into Git metadata. A branch can still edit the convenience source files, but installed hooks execute the trusted runner and runtime snapshot under `.git/ciecopilot-hooks/` until a developer intentionally reinstalls hooks from a trusted baseline. If the runtime snapshot changes after installation, the runner fails closed and asks the developer to reinstall trusted hooks.\n\nThis does not claim local hooks are a complete boundary against a user who can directly edit `.git/hooks`; it specifically blocks branch/worktree-controlled guardrail mutation from silently changing installed hook behavior.\n\n## Regression Tests\n\nAdds `tests/git-hooks/trusted-hooks.test.js` to verify:\n\n- committed `.githooks/pre-commit` and `.githooks/pre-push` do not directly call `scripts/git-hooks/guardrails.js`;\n- generated `.git/hooks/*` files are shell wrappers, do not use `NODE_OPTIONS` or `--experimental-default-type`, and call only `.git/ciecopilot-hooks/hook-runner.cjs`;\n- the trusted `.cjs` runner verifies checksum success and fails closed on mismatch without `NODE_OPTIONS`;\n- the installer writes trusted hooks only inside a temp Git metadata directory and does not write `.git/hooks/package.json`;\n- existing pre-commit and pre-push evaluator behavior still blocks protected branches and dirty pushes.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `npm test -- --runInBand tests/git-hooks/trusted-hooks.test.js` passed, 7 tests.\n- `npm test -- --runInBand scripts/git-hooks/__tests__/guardrails.test.js` passed, 8 tests.\n- `npm test -- --runInBand scripts/workflow/__tests__/workflow-scripts.test.js` passed, 7 tests.\n- `npm test -- --runInBand tests/ao/entry-topology-contract.test.js` passed, 4 tests.\n- `npm run git:hooks:install -- --dry-run` passed and did not mutate real `.git`.\n- `git diff --check` passed.\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` exited 0 with `top_status: healthy` and a clean worktree.","created_at":"2026-07-09T13:29:45Z","updated_at":"2026-07-09T15:05:44Z","closed_at":"2026-07-09T15:05:44Z","merged_at":"2026-07-09T15:05:43Z","merge_commit_sha":"b401d62324f76cf4668a29608a124103418e55e1","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1518/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1518/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1518/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/273b5e09e7adcfb474527b2db4053f98dfb0e45e","head":{"label":"Samsen879:codex/trusted-hook-runtime-snapshot","ref":"codex/trusted-hook-runtime-snapshot","sha":"273b5e09e7adcfb474527b2db4053f98dfb0e45e","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","